  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting EU engagement with Civil Society in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Global objective&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to enhance EU engagement with civil society in Mozambique.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective(s)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1)To support the implementation and monitoring of the EU Roadmap for engagement with Civil Society in Mozambique (2021-2027)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2)To enhance partnership and constructive dialogue between the EU (and EU Member States) and civil society organisations in Mozambique&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3)To support mainstreaming of civil society in the MIP priority areas and ensure coherence and efficiency of the EU portfolio in this domain.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
